Miscellaneous (Misc) CTF Challenges
Beginner-friendly, practical guide to solving Miscellaneous (Misc) challenges in Capture The Flag (CTF) competitions.
🎯 Purpose
Misc challenges contain problems that don't fit neatly into categories like Web, Crypto, Pwn, Reverse Engineering, or Forensics.
They test your ability to:
🧠 Think logically and creatively
🔍 Investigate unfamiliar data
🐍 Write scripts and automate tasks
🛠️ Use different tools together
🔗 Combine multiple cybersecurity techniques
